  "findings": {
    "wing": "All eight client bodies have a Wing socket attached to WeaponSpine; use the socket transform, not a nonexistent Wing bone. Retain native type-4 model rotation.",
    "posture": "823 sit-down and 824 stand-up, one-second playback override. Movement waits for the same scaled native clock STOP boundary as rendering; no first-frame skip for these transitions.",
    "pickup": "Existing compatible stacks precede empty slots. Partial pickup leaves ground remainder; ordinary full-stack/nonstackable drag swaps records.",
    "prana": "Individual corpse-born motes use native homing with explicitly requested upward launch bias; absorbed on contact, no player-side replacement graph.",
    "chat": "Native visible panel, distinct bounded chat/system histories, category colours and authoritative damage/reward events. Group and whisper receive presentation is implemented; remote services remain unavailable offline.",
    "commands": "201 English runtime entries from 287 GM source rows plus 19 early-whisper rows; 32 implemented offline commands, other services explicitly unavailable."
